<LegalPage title="About this directory" description="How Top Crypto Airdrops collects and explains campaign records." path="/about/" kicker="ABOUT / EDITORIAL CONTEXT">
  <p>Top Crypto Airdrops is a source-tracked directory for comparing crypto reward campaigns. The site turns a changing public listing into a local record with clear dates, requirements, reward wording, and uncertainty.</p>
  <h2>What we add</h2>
  <p>Our pages are written around the information a reader needs to compare campaigns: what the listing says, what is not confirmed, what participation signals are visible, and where the source can be checked. We do not embed wallets or ask for private keys.</p>
  <h2>What we do not promise</h2>
  <p>A listing is not an endorsement, a safety certification, an investment recommendation, or a promise of reward. Campaigns can expire, change terms, or be unavailable in a reader's jurisdiction.</p>
</LegalPage>
